# app.get("/text").post("/orders");
# `app.get("/text")`: the text goes down through a method that a loop has laid on the object, a method of a prototype, `new Layer(..)` and a helper before it comes to RegExp. No function on that way knows it by itself,
# and whoever names the one that calls RegExp knows it no better. The body of the module that the program starts with is gone through as the program goes through it.
